    "detailed_description": "<strong>Plungeez</strong> is a 2D Platformer Puzzle Metroidvania in the Puxel Art style set in Salvador, Bahia, Brazil. <br><br>You play as Bonnie, a fierce plummer that, after a work incident and falling in the underground, must escape  solving puzzles, collecting plungers, climbing walls, lighting lamps, diving underwater, fixing pipes, and much more.<br><br><strong>Join Bonnie in this adventure!</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Plungeez</strong> is a 2D Platformer Puzzle Metroidvania in the Puxel Art style set in Salvador, Bahia, Brazil. <br><br>You play as Bonnie, a fierce plummer that, after a work incident and falling in the underground, must escape  solving puzzles, collecting plungers, climbing walls, lighting lamps, diving underwater, fixing pipes, and much more.<br><br><strong>Join Bonnie in this adventure!</strong>",
    "short_description": "Take a dive in the world of Plungeez, a puzzle platformer where Bonnie, a fierce woman who, after falling in the underground, must explore the sewers of Salvador in search of a way out. Light torches, boilers, and use plungers to climb and solve puzzles!",
